00:31:30,280 --> 00:31:33,640
Hysteresis is a crucial property of systems with memory.

483
00:31:34,500 --> 00:31:37,800
In physics, it means the state of a system depends on its history.

484
00:31:37,800 --> 00:31:42,320
Simply put, the path up is not the same as the path down.

485
00:31:42,320 --> 00:31:46,560
