486
00:31:46,780 --> 00:31:48,680
The heat is already in the water.

487
00:31:49,140 --> 00:31:49,580
Exactly.

488
00:31:49,980 --> 00:31:56,220
If you hit phase three, turbulent virality, and you realize it's a nightmare, and you delete

